# ============================================================ BY PATTERN ===
# These rules were written twice, literally, once for a1a2/ and once for
# b1b2/, and the second copy was made by hand when book 2 published. The A1/A2
# republication on 1 Sep 2026 found what that costs: the old book's
# `a1a2/img/*.png` was still here, and the new book keeps its 220 illustrations
# at exactly that path. `git add a1a2/` would have staged the pages and
# silently skipped every drawing.
#
# So the rules are by pattern now. A sixth book inherits them without anybody
# remembering to copy a block.

# Retired assets. Recordings and drawings that no page asks for any more. They
# stay on disk so nothing is lost and so a rename can be undone, and they stay
# OUT of the repository: a repository carries its weight for ever.
*/audio/_retired/
*/img/_retired/

# The audio QA report: what a transcriber HEARD back for each clip against what
# was sent. A build artefact, regenerated by qa_audio.py, useful to whoever is
# cutting audio and to nobody else.
*/audio/qa_report.json

# The render signature: model id, voice ids and voice settings. It is what the
# FACTORY needs to know whether a clip is stale, and it is the production recipe
# for a book's sound. It belongs to the kit, not to a public web root.
*/audio/render_signature.json

# `audio/provenance.json` and `audio/peaks.json` are NOT here on purpose: the
# player reads peaks, and provenance is what lets anybody check which clip came
# from which line. Both are published for every book.

# ------------------------------------------------------- NEVER PUBLISHED ---
# The review build of any book: it carries the answer key, the banner and the
# watermark. It has its own folder outside this repository and no copy of it
# belongs here, under any name.
*-PROPOSTA.html

# The behaviour gate's runner. `varredura.sh` drops it into the build folder to
# run it from the same origin as the pages; it is a test harness that lists a
# book's internals, and it is not a page of the book.
behaviour-*.html
